Fixture projects for ct-test's framework detectors and providers — sample
source trees that the discovery/provider suites POINT AT, not tests of this
repo. Several of them (nim_unittest_project/tests/test_lexical_edge_cases.nim
in particular) exist precisely to be mis-scanned, so running them, or editing
them to carry a per-file marker, would change the thing they are a fixture
for. Their real assertions live in src/ct_test/nim_unittest_provider_test.nim,
discovery_test.nim and rust_libtest_provider_test.nim.
